### 15. Transactions Collection
Records all financial transactions (fees, payments)

```json
{
  "_id": ObjectId,
  "transactionType": "registration_fee", // "registration_fee", "renewal_fee", "donation", "zakat"
  "amount": 5000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "fromUserId": ObjectId, // Reference to Users (who paid)
  "toUserId": ObjectId, // Reference to Users (who received - Super Admin for fees)
  "masjidId": ObjectId, // Reference to Masjids (if applicable)
  "upiTransactionId": "UPI12345678901234567890",
  "recipientUpiId": "superadmin@upi", // UPI ID of recipient
  "paymentProofScreenshot": "url_to_screenshot",
  "transactionStatus": "completed", // "pending_verification", "completed", "rejected"
  "description": "Registration fee for Al-Noor Masjid",
  "receiptNumber": "RECEIPT-2026-00001",
  "receiptUrl": "url_to_receipt",
  "transactionDate": ISODate("2026-05-12"),
  "createdAt": ISODate("2026-05-12")
}
```

**Indexes**:
- `fromUserId`
- `toUserId`
- `masjidId`
- `transactionStatus`
- `upiTransactionId` (unique within transaction date)
- `transactionDate`
